 "fields": {
  "wg-selector-2-href": "/en/success-stories/franchise-bagelstein-innovorder",
  "wg-selector-2-href-2": "/success-stories/franchise-bagelstein-innovorder",
  "title-post": "Bagelstein was against the terminals... until he saw the impact on the average basket size.",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/699486230cb4e9719562b036_Screenshot%202026-02-09%20at%2010.51.40.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/699486230cb4e9719562b036_Screenshot%202026-02-09%20at%2010.51.40-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/699486230cb4e9719562b036_Screenshot%202026-02-09%20at%2010.51.40-p-800.avif 800w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/699486230cb4e9719562b036_Screenshot%202026-02-09%20at%2010.51.40-p-1080.avif 1080w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/699486230cb4e9719562b036_Screenshot%202026-02-09%20at%2010.51.40.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/682e3eec906bbc17bc05f31f_Logo-Bagelstein-NBO-512x474-1.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "Bagelstein was against the terminals... until he saw the impact on the average basket size.",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WCa2jTFFwgg\" title=\"Thierry Veil was against the terminals... until he saw the impact on average basket size.\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <p>In this interview, <strong>Thierry Veil</strong>, co-founder of <strong>Bagelstein</strong>, shares his unfiltered feedback on digital technology in franchising and the integration of kiosks into his network.</p>\n          <h2>“I didn't want any terminals.”</h2>\n          <p>When Thierry Veil launched Bagelstein nearly 15 years ago, the concept was based on one central pillar: <strong>customer experience</strong>.</p>\n          <p>Homemade, quirky tone, strong branding, human connection.</p>\n          <p>The idea of installing self-service kiosks? In his opinion, incompatible with the customer experience.</p>\n          <blockquote>“I created this concept around one thing: the customer experience.” Thierry Veil, co-founder of Bagelstein</blockquote>\n          <p>Like many restaurant owners, the fear is clear:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li>Loss of human contact</li>\n            <li>Standardization</li>\n            <li>Dehumanization of the point of sale</li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2>The turning point: testing rather than assuming</h2>\n          <p>The market is changing fast. Very fast.</p>\n          <p>Today, a restaurant must be more than just good.<br>It must:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li>Provide a seamless experience</li>\n            <li>Maintain an excellent Google rating</li>\n            <li>Optimize your operations</li>\n            <li>Maximizing your average basket size</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>Faced with this development, a strategic decision is required: <strong>to test</strong>.</p>\n          <p>And the test changes everything.</p>\n          <h2>The real impact of ordering kiosks</h2>\n          <p>Result observed in the network:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li><strong>Significant increase in average basket</strong>size</li>\n            <li>Streamlining traffic in restaurants</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>The conclusion is clear: the terminal has not ruined the customer experience at all—quite the contrary.<br></p>\n          <p>Thierry Veil admits it himself:</p>\n          <blockquote>“Who am I to deprive my franchise network of this growth?”</blockquote>\n          <h2>A complete ecosystem: kiosk, cash register, and KDS</h2>\n          <p>The project was not limited to installing a terminal.</p>\n          <p>The network has deployed a comprehensive ecosystem:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">Self-ordering kiosks</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/en/restaurant-touch-cash-register\">Tactile checkout</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\">KDS</a> (kitchen display system) for kitchen productivity</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>The goal: to create a coherent system that streamlines the customer journey from order to production.</p>\n          <h3>-</h3>\n          <p>You want to equip your <a href=\"/en/commercial-catering/franchise\"><strong>franchise</strong></a> ? Call on an Innovorder expert and discover how to streamline the checkout process!</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Bagelstein",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Franchise",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595abf1a0222_%C3%A9cran%20de%20production.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Kitchen Display System</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
